🧮 Important Concepts

Ordinary Year:
365 days = 52 weeks + 1 odd day

Leap Year:
366 days = 52 weeks + 2 odd days

Leap Year Rule:
A year is a leap year if it is divisible by 4.
Century years must be divisible by 400.

